      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(opper): list the shared effort levels for deepseek-v4-flash (#14322)

* fix(opper): list the shared effort levels for deepseek-v4-flash

Every pooled member of Opper&amp;#39;s deepseek-v4-flash pool now takes
reasoning_effort, and none, low, medium and high are the levels they
share (https://api.opper.ai/v3/models, read 2026-11-23). The entry
listed no effort control, so clients could not turn thinking on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;

